gpui.f.updates = Updates
gpui.f.updates.note = Settings, Network and updates picks the stable or the nightly channel.
gpui.f.home.title = Where your data is kept
gpui.f.home.body = Backplane keeps your threads, settings, bots and keys in one folder on this computer. A background program, the hub, runs your agents from that folder. It keeps running when you close the window, so agents finish their work. Each computer usually has one.
