gpui.f.phone.title = A phone
gpui.f.phone.body = Install the Backplane app: iOS through TestFlight, Android from the signed file on the release page. Then scan the QR code with the app, or type the short code and this hub's address. Each invitation works once, for ten minutes. The phone needs a network route to this hub, usually Tailscale on the same tailnet. Treat the QR code and the link as passwords.
