gpui.f.try.settings = Closes setup and opens Settings. Finish setup in the sidebar brings you back.
gpui.f.open.settings = Open Settings
gpui.f.tour.settings.body = Settings holds the choices for the whole hub. This device holds the choices for this window only. The pages are {pages}. Accounts is where you add more Claude and Codex accounts, and Hubs switches this window to another hub.
gpui.f.uber.title = Your uberbot
gpui.f.uber.is = {name} is your uberbot. Open it at the top of the sidebar for the status of everything: what runs, what waits for you and what failed.
gpui.f.uber.pick = Your uberbot is the bot you talk to first. It sees each project, thread, bot and machine, and its Status tab shows what runs and what waits for you. Make one of your bots the uberbot. You can change it later.
gpui.f.uber.create = Your uberbot is the bot you talk to first. It sees each project, thread, bot and machine, and its Status tab shows what runs and what waits for you. Create it now and rename it later.
gpui.f.uber.make = Make {name} my uberbot
gpui.f.uber.create.btn = Create my uberbot
